## Training vs Consulting vs Done-For-You

Training builds the team's skills against a structured curriculum. The outcome is a shared method, completed exercises and enough understanding to repeat the work without relying on me for every decision.

Consulting answers current questions session by session. It suits an experienced team that can implement but wants senior direction on a problem or plan.

My [SEO strategy consulting for in-house teams](/services/seo-strategy-consulting-expert-guidance-for-in-house-teams/) is ad-hoc advisory support at £200 per session. Training is the separate curriculum-based product priced per workshop or programme.

Done-for-you SEO places strategy and ongoing execution outside the team. A [full SEO retainer](/services/seo-retainer/) is a better fit when internal capacity is the constraint rather than knowledge. The decision should be based on who will own implementation after the initial diagnosis.

## SEO Training Questions

**Is the training generic or specific to our site?**

The training is specific to your business. Every exercise uses your site, your Google Search Console data and your competitors so attendees work on decisions they will make after the session.

**How is training different from SEO consulting?**

Training builds your team's skills through a defined curriculum. Consulting answers your current questions session by session and assumes your team already has the capacity to act on the guidance.

**How much does SEO training cost?**

Half-day workshops cost £750, full-day workshops cost £1,250 and the six-week team programme costs £2,500. Each price covers a team of up to 8 people. The programme includes six weekly 90-minute sessions, set work and feedback during the programme.

## Training Pricing

Training prices are fixed per team of up to 8 people:

- **Half-day workshop: £750.** Three hours of live training with tailored preparation, materials, exercise templates and a follow-up question and answer session.
- **Full-day workshop: £1,250.** Six hours of live training with tailored preparation, materials, exercise templates and a follow-up question and answer session.
- **Six-week team programme: £2,500.** Six weekly 90-minute live sessions with tailored preparation, set work, materials and feedback on exercises and questions during the programme.

On-site delivery within Berkshire and the Thames Valley adds travel at cost. Remote delivery has no travel charge. Every engagement begins with a free 20-minute call to scope the team, curriculum and delivery format.

